  "title": "Tom Thumb Bars (Coconut Specialties)",
  "description": "These are chewy moist coconut bars. This was a special treat during the 1930s and 40s which my mother served often to our farming community by popular demand.",
  "authors": [
    "Juanita"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-04T23:58:19-05:00",
